cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, these models or this code, please cite both the article and this archived record."
title: "CWEC-PC-TCN-MPC: spectrum-driven wave power realizations, physics-conditioned forecasting models and hard-constrained flywheel control benchmarks"
abstract: >-
  Synthesized electrical-power realizations for a breakwater-integrated coastal wave energy
  converter with a tapered collection channel, generated from a Pierson-Moskowitz spectrum
  with independent random phases and a wave-to-wire coefficient calibrated once at a baseline
  sea state and then held fixed. The record also contains the trained physics-conditioned
  temporal convolutional network and its neural baselines, the hard-constrained flywheel
  model predictive controller, and the scripts that reproduce every figure and table of the
  accompanying article.
